{"id":3522,"date":"2026-03-29T10:03:45","date_gmt":"2026-03-29T10:03:45","guid":{"rendered":"https:\/\/cde-me.com\/?p=3522"},"modified":"2026-03-29T20:06:10","modified_gmt":"2026-03-29T20:06:10","slug":"durability-assessment-and-service-life-prediction","status":"publish","type":"post","link":"https:\/\/cde-me.com\/durability-assessment-and-service-life-prediction\/","title":{"rendered":"Durability Assessment and Service Life Prediction"},"content":{"rendered":"\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Introduction<\/h2>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Durability plays a critical role in determining how long a structure can perform under environmental and operational conditions. Without proper evaluation, deterioration may progress unnoticed, leading to costly repairs and reduced service life.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Durability assessment provides insight into current condition and future performance, enabling informed decision-making.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">What is Durability Assessment<\/h2>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Durability assessment evaluates the mechanisms that cause deterioration and predicts the remaining service life of a structure.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">It combines material testing, environmental analysis, and engineering modelling to understand how structures will perform over time.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Our Approach<\/h2>\n\n\n\n<h4 class=\"wp-block-heading\">1. Exposure Analysis<\/h4>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Environmental conditions such as marine exposure, humidity, temperature variations, and chemical presence are evaluated.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<h4 class=\"wp-block-heading\">2. Material Evaluation<\/h4>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Concrete properties, permeability, and resistance to deterioration are assessed through testing.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<h4 class=\"wp-block-heading\">3. Deterioration Modelling<\/h4>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Advanced models simulate processes such as chloride ingress and carbonation to predict future performance.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<h4 class=\"wp-block-heading\">4. Service Life Prediction<\/h4>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Based on analysis, the remaining service life of the structure is estimated.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Scope of Services<\/h2>\n\n\n<style>.wp-block-kadence-iconlist.kt-svg-icon-list-items3522_0023ab-20:not(.this-stops-third-party-issues){margin-top:0px;margin-bottom:0px;}.wp-block-kadence-iconlist.kt-svg-icon-list-items3522_0023ab-20 ul.kt-svg-icon-list:not(.this-prevents-issues):not(.this-stops-third-party-issues):not(.tijsloc){margin-top:0px;margin-right:0px;margin-bottom:var(--global-kb-spacing-sm, 1.5rem);margin-left:0px;}.wp-block-kadence-iconlist.kt-svg-icon-list-items3522_0023ab-20 ul.kt-svg-icon-list{grid-row-gap:5px;}.wp-block-kadence-iconlist.kt-svg-icon-list-items3522_0023ab-20 ul.kt-svg-icon-list .kt-svg-icon-list-item-wrap .kt-svg-icon-list-single{margin-right:10px;}.kt-svg-icon-list-items3522_0023ab-20 ul.kt-svg-icon-list .kt-svg-icon-list-level-0 .kt-svg-icon-list-single svg{font-size:20px;}<\/style>\n<div class=\"wp-block-kadence-iconlist kt-svg-icon-list-items kt-svg-icon-list-items3522_0023ab-20 kt-svg-icon-list-columns-1 alignnone\"><ul class=\"kt-svg-icon-list\"><style>.kt-svg-icon-list-item-3522_d12273-cc .kt-svg-icon-list-text mark.kt-highlight{background-color:unset;font-style:normal;color:#f76a0c;-webkit-box-decoration-break:clone;box-decoration-break:clone;padding-top:0px;padding-right:0px;padding-bottom:0px;padding-left:0px;}<\/style>\n<li class=\"wp-block-kadence-listitem kt-svg-icon-list-item-wrap kt-svg-icon-list-item-3522_d12273-cc\"><span class=\"kb-svg-icon-wrap kb-svg-icon-fe_checkCircle kt-svg-icon-list-single\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\"  fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" xmlns=\"http:\/\/www.w3.org\/2000\/svg\"  aria-hidd